Bards of Erenor look to Lucius, a bawdy playwright and bard with a penchant for romance. A symbol of romance, he would later become Anir, the god of art.

'''Songcraft''' is a support [[Skill Trees|skill tree]] built around Perform skills. Each song is an ongoing spell that buffs the whole party with movement speed, defense, damage or debuff protection, and the tree adds healing, mana restoration, charms and a stun. Its own damage is limited, so it is usually paired with trees that deal damage.

== Skills ==
=== Combat skills ===
{{TreeSkills|Songcraft|combat}}

=== Passive skills ===
Passives cost 1 skill point each and unlock after you have spent the listed number of points in Songcraft.
{{TreeSkills|Songcraft|passives}}

=== Abyssal skills ===
The [[Abyssal Skills]] have to be unlocked through a questline and don't require skill points to be used.
{{TreeSkills|Songcraft|abyssal}}

